      "filename": "19870514100NR Rheinsberg Schloß Sanatorium.jpg",
      "title": "File:19870514100NR Rheinsberg Schloß Sanatorium.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/10/19870514100NR_Rheinsberg_Schlo%C3%9F_Sanatorium.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
